  "description": "Ezio had a one-night stand with a man named Heisi. The next day, he was transferred to the National Criminal Investigation Agency's Criminal Record Management Team, and when he went to work, his wallet had been stolen!? What's worse, the prime suspect turned out to be someone he was in charge of... \n\nI'm going to catch Heisi Rinotti!\n\n(Source: BookCube, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of BookCube's Omegaverse Danpyeonseon (오메가버스 단편선) Collection.*",
